source fixture "T's fixture for S's kernel tests (invented values)"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place pocket: cash PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place later: accounts PLN lives 2026-04-01..

place world: outside lives 2026-01-01..

place shop: outside lives 2026-01-01..

input bank: observed

input last_day: date

input fee_amt: money PLN

input big_put: money PLN

input small_put: money PLN

move last_fee: transfers
  on last_day
  at last_day
  leg cash from konto to shop amount fee_amt

move last_dec: transfers
  on last_day
  at last_day
  reads pocket
  leg cash from world to pocket amount if bal(pocket) > big_put then small_put else fee_amt

ask q_end: bal(konto, d), bal(pocket, d) for d in [2026-03-30, 2026-03-31] law cut

ask q_later: bal(later, 2026-03-31) law cut

ask q_res: residuals konto 2026-03 law cut

