,7:g9/sign,2:g9,17:run g9/sign.tally,7498:13:g9/sign.tally,7475:model g9_sign
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-25
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-03-31
  note "T, issue #41, G9: booking a leg and the sign rule (L §5.10, §5.14, E §4.2 steps 4-5): claims, debts and a holding broken by a first-batch plan and by a decision's legs, each refused (RUN-PLACE) beside a twin that stays at 0 or nets to 0 in its batch; a claim anchored below zero at a close, which refcore and the engine leave at -5.00 unrefused (S keeps refcore's bytes; the spec round decides, #46), beside a twin anchored at 0; a leg out of a place outside its lifespan (RUN-LIFESPAN) beside a leg of 0 that books nothing; cash below zero in two stretches (WARN-NEGATIVE twice); a hole amount and a hole day, each on places of their own."

source fixture "T's fixture for S's kernel tests (invented values)"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

unit etf_unit "a fund unit"

index month = month 2026-01..2026-03

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place wallet: cash PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place lent: claims PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place lent2: claims PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place lent3: claims PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place lent4: claims PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place owed: debts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place fund: holdings etf_unit priced fund_price lives 2026-01-01..

place fund2: holdings etf_unit priced fund_price lives 2026-01-01..

place gone: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..2026-02-27

place gone2: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..2026-02-27

place box_h: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place box_d: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place market: outside lives 2026-01-01..

place world: outside lives 2026-01-01..

input fund_price[m in month]: num PLN/etf_unit

input back_amt[m in month]: money PLN

input lend_amt[m in month]: money PLN

input swing_amt[m in month]: money PLN

input gone2_amt[m in month]: money PLN

input over_amt: money PLN

input payoff_amt[m in month]: money PLN

input sell_units[m in month]: num etf_unit

input spend_amt[m in month]: money PLN

input refill_amt: money PLN

input gone_amt[m in month]: money PLN

input hole_amt: money PLN question "How much came in?"

input hole_day: date question "When does it come?"

input small_amt: money PLN

input mystery_day: date

input first_day: date

input pay_dom: int

input dec_dom: int

input spend_dom: int

input refill_dom: int

move back[m in month]: transfers
  on day_of(m, pay_dom)
  at start_of(m)
  leg cash from lent to konto amount back_amt[m]

move swing_out[m in month]: transfers
  on day_of(m, pay_dom)
  at start_of(m)
  leg cash from lent2 to konto amount swing_amt[m]

move swing_in[m in month]: transfers
  on day_of(m, pay_dom)
  at start_of(m)
  leg cash from konto to lent2 amount lend_amt[m]

move repay[m in month]: transfers
  on day_of(m, dec_dom)
  at start_of(m)
  reads lent3
  leg cash from lent3 to world amount if bal(lent3) > small_amt then bal(lent3) + over_amt else bal(lent3)

move payoff[m in month]: transfers
  on day_of(m, pay_dom)
  at start_of(m)
  leg cash from konto to owed amount payoff_amt[m]

move sell[m in month]: etf_sells
  on day_of(m, pay_dom)
  at start_of(m)
  leg units from fund to market amount sell_units[m]

move spend[m in month]: transfers
  on day_of(m, spend_dom)
  at start_of(m)
  leg cash from wallet to world amount spend_amt[m]

move refill[m in month]: transfers
  on day_of(m, refill_dom)
  at start_of(m)
  leg cash from world to wallet amount refill_amt

move into_gone[m in month]: transfers
  on day_of(m, pay_dom)
  at start_of(m)
  leg cash from gone to world amount gone_amt[m]

move into_gone2[m in month]: transfers
  on day_of(m, pay_dom)
  at start_of(m)
  leg cash from world to gone2 amount gone2_amt[m]

move dump[m in month]: etf_sells
  on day_of(m, dec_dom)
  at start_of(m)
  reads fund2
  leg units from fund2 to market amount if bal(fund2) > sell_units[m] then sell_units[m] else bal(fund2) + sell_units[m]

move mystery: transfers
  on mystery_day
  at mystery_day
  leg cash from world to box_h amount hole_amt

move vague: transfers
  on hole_day
  at first_day
  leg cash from world to box_d amount small_amt

kind etf_sells: event certain
  leg units: etf_unit

ask q_claims: bal(lent, d), bal(lent2, d), bal(lent3, d), bal(lent4, d) for d in [2026-01-31, 2026-02-28, 2026-03-10, 2026-03-20, 2026-03-31] law cut

ask q_more: bal(owed, d), bal(fund, d), bal(gone, d), bal(gone2, d), bal(konto, d), bal(fund2, d) for d in [2026-01-31, 2026-02-28, 2026-03-31] law cut

ask q_wallet: bal(wallet, d) for d in [2026-01-14, 2026-01-15, 2026-01-25, 2026-02-15, 2026-02-25, 2026-03-15] law cut

ask q_holes: bal(box_h, d), bal(box_d, d) for d in [2026-01-10, 2026-01-31, 2026-02-01, 2026-03-31] law cut

