,10:g7/running,2:g7,20:run g7/running.tally,6461:16:g7/running.tally,6435:model g7_running
  tally 2
  on 2026-02-15
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-03-31
  note "T, issue #41, G7: running reads (L §5.14.1, §5.14.3, E §4.2 step 3): a decision's plain read of its own day (RUN-CYCLE) and of a later one (RUN-FUTURE) beside reads of its day's start and of the day before; a decision on the cut's day and one before, read through flows; flows of a place through a later day, through its own day and through the day before, with a plan on its day; flows of a decision move through a later day, its own day and the day before; two instances on a day that read each other's place through flows with no ties by (RUN-TIE) beside a twin that reads it through the day before. Each refused decision moves into a place of its own, so the rest is answered."

source fixture "T's fixture for S's kernel tests (invented values)"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

index box = [first, second]

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place p_cyc: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place p_fut: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place p_ok: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place p_ffut: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place p_ftd: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place p_fpv: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place p_dfut: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place p_dpast: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place p_dtd: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place p_cut: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place tie_jar[b in box]: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place calm_jar[b in box]: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place world: outside lives 2026-01-01..

place shop: outside lives 2026-01-01..

input rent_day: date

input rent_amt: money PLN

input chip_day: date

input chip_amt: money PLN

input cyc_day: date

input cyc_read: date

input fut_day: date

input later_day: date

input early_day: date

input prev_day: date

input keep: money PLN

input ffut_day: date

input f_from: date

input f_late: date

input f_today: date

input f_prev: date

input flow_day: date

input dec_day: date

input d_late: date

input d_early: date

input d_today: date

input small: money PLN

input big: money PLN

input cut_day: date

input tie_day: date

input tie_end: date

input calm_end: date

move rent: transfers
  on rent_day
  leg cash from konto to shop amount rent_amt

move chip: transfers
  on chip_day
  leg cash from konto to shop amount chip_amt

move cyc: transfers
  on cyc_day
  reads konto
  leg cash from world to p_cyc amount bal(konto, cyc_read)

move fut: transfers
  on fut_day
  reads konto
  leg cash from world to p_fut amount bal(konto, later_day)

move early: transfers
  on early_day
  reads konto
  leg cash from world to p_ok amount bal(konto, early_day start) + bal(konto, prev_day) - keep

move ffut: transfers
  on ffut_day
  reads konto
  leg cash from world to p_ffut amount 0 - flows(konto, f_from .. f_late)

move ftoday: transfers
  on flow_day
  reads konto
  leg cash from world to p_ftd amount 0 - flows(konto, f_from .. f_today)

move fprev: transfers
  on flow_day
  reads konto
  leg cash from world to p_fpv amount 0 - flows(konto, f_from .. f_prev)

move dfut: transfers
  on dec_day
  reads ftoday
  leg cash from world to p_dfut amount flows(ftoday, f_from .. d_late)

move dpast: transfers
  on dec_day
  reads ftoday
  leg cash from world to p_dpast amount flows(ftoday, f_from .. d_early)

move dtoday: transfers
  on dec_day
  reads ftoday
  leg cash from world to p_dtd amount flows(ftoday, f_from .. d_today)

move oncut: transfers
  on cut_day
  reads konto
  leg cash from world to p_cut amount if bal(konto) > 0 then small else big

move tflow[b in box]: transfers
  on tie_day
  reads tie_jar
  leg cash from world to tie_jar[b] amount if flows(tie_jar[first], f_from .. tie_end) > 0 then small else big

move cflow[b in box]: transfers
  on tie_day
  reads calm_jar
  leg cash from world to calm_jar[b] amount if flows(calm_jar[first], f_from .. calm_end) > 0 then small else big

ask q_run: bal(p_cyc, d), bal(p_fut, d), bal(p_ok, d), bal(p_ffut, d), bal(p_ftd, d), bal(p_fpv, d), bal(p_dfut, d), bal(p_dpast, d), bal(p_dtd, d), bal(konto, PLN, d) for d in [2026-01-09, 2026-01-20, 2026-03-20] law cut

ask q_flows: flows(ftoday, 2026-01-01 .. 2026-04-01), flows(dpast, 2026-01-01 .. 2026-04-01), flows(oncut, 2026-01-01 .. 2026-04-01), flows(early, 2026-01-01 .. 2026-04-01) law cut

ask q_tie: bal(tie_jar[first], d), bal(tie_jar[second], d), bal(calm_jar[first], d), bal(calm_jar[second], d) for d in [2026-01-19, 2026-01-20] law cut

