source fixture "T's fixture for S's kernel tests (invented values)"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

index n = 1..40

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place p_deep: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place old: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..2026-01-31

place world: outside lives 2026-01-01..

input one: num

input top: int

input deep_day: date

input pay_day: date

input pay_amt: money PLN

input small: money PLN

input big: money PLN

def acc[k in n]: num
  note "a chain of forty links, each reading the one before"
  rule base v facts = if k == one then one else acc[k - one] + one

move deep: transfers
  on deep_day
  reads konto
  leg cash from world to p_deep amount if acc[top] > 0 then (if bal(konto) > 0 then small else big) else big

move pay: transfers
  on pay_day
  leg cash from world to old amount pay_amt

ask a_flows: flows(pay, 2026-02-01 .. 2026-02-28) law cut

ask b_bal: bal(p_deep, 2026-01-31), flows(pay, 2026-01-01 .. 2026-01-31) law cut

