unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place p_pp: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place z_box: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place world: outside lives 2026-01-01..

input t_day: date

input t_own: date

input d_end: date

input div_z: num

input small: money PLN

move pp: transfers
  on t_day
  reads konto
  leg cash from world to p_pp amount bal(konto, d_end) from t_own

move zz: transfers
  on t_day
  reads z_box
  when bal(z_box) / div_z > 0
  leg cash from world to z_box amount small

ask q_after: flows(pp, 2026-03-01 .. 2026-03-31), bal(konto, 2026-03-04), bal(p_pp, 2026-03-04) law cut

