  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T, tally 2.1.2 (issue #44), G11: the twin of g11/settle_order: turn moves only t[2026-03]'s from place, to konto3, and bank[r1], from the new from place, settles its adjustment; the reads that count it answer the same numbers in either order (q_fb, q_bf, q_ff)."

